      "translations": {
        "en.bab-ul-qaim-publications": [
          "Hadith.1233 - Hammad ibn Uthman narrated from Imran Al-Halabi, who said:\n\"Imam Jafar ibn Muhammad Al-Sadiq (as) was asked about a man who prays the Jumu’ah prayer as four rak'ahs. Should he recite aloud?\nImam (as) replied: \"Yes, and there is Qunoot (a supplication) in the second rak'ah.\""
        ]
      }
